---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const APP_URL = "https://trading.onquantex.com";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Referral Program"
  description="Invite people to Quantex with your referral link and earn a reward when they make their first deposit."
>
  <section class="qx-ref-hero">
    <div class="qx-container">
      <span class="qx-eyebrow">Referral Program</span>
      <h1>Bring someone in, earn when they deposit</h1>
      <p class="qx-lead">
        Every account gets its own referral link. Share it, and when
        someone signs up through it and makes their first deposit, you
        earn a reward.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="qx-section">
    <div class="qx-container qx-prose">
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Sign up (or log in) and grab your unique referral code from your account.</li>
        <li>Share your link however you'd share anything: a message, a post, a group chat.</li>
        <li>Someone signs up through it and makes their first deposit.</li>
        <li>You earn a referral reward. The exact terms are shown in your account, not buried in fine print.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="qx-section qx-section-alt">
    <div class="qx-container qx-prose">
      <h2>Why it only pays out on a real deposit</h2>
      <p>
        A referral only earns a reward once the person you invited
        actually funds their account, not just at sign-up. That's
        deliberate: it keeps the program tied to someone genuinely
        starting to use Quantex, rather than an empty account created
        purely to farm a reward. Referral credits go through a review
        step before they're paid out, the same way any other credit to
        your balance does.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="qx-cta">
    <div class="qx-container qx-cta-inner">
      <div>
        <h2>Get your referral link</h2>
        <p>Create an account to find your referral code and start sharing it.</p>
        <a class="qx-btn-primary qx-btn-lg" href={`${APP_URL}/signup`}>Trade Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .qx-ref-hero {
    padding: var(--space-48) 0 var(--space-24);
  }
  .qx-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-data);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--teal-base);
    background: var(--teal-pale);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-8);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }
  .qx-ref-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 48px);
    color: var(--ink-base);
    max-width: 20ch;
  }
  .qx-lead {
    margin-top: var(--space-16);
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .qx-section {
    padding: var(--space-48) 0;
  }
  .qx-section-alt {
    background: var(--cream-deep);
  }

  .qx-cta {
    padding: var(--space-48) 0 var(--space-32);
  }
  .qx-cta-inner {
    background: var(--teal-deep);
    border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
    padding: var(--space-48);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .qx-cta-inner h2 {
    color: var(--on-accent);
  }
  .qx-cta-inner p {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    color: var(--teal-sage);
    max-width: 48ch;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .qx-cta-inner .qx-btn-primary {
    margin-top: var(--space-16);
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .qx-container {
      padding: 0 var(--space-16);
    }
    .qx-ref-hero {
      padding: var(--space-32) 0 var(--space-16);
    }
    .qx-ref-hero h1 {
      font-size: 26px;
    }
    .qx-lead {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .qx-section {
      padding: var(--space-32) 0;
    }
    .qx-cta-inner {
      padding: var(--space-32) var(--space-24);
    }
  }
</style>
